1) Reject if the paragraph is code/logs/config or anchor would sit inside backticks/fenced code.

2) Anchor must be a contiguous substring from paragraph, ≤ 5 words, semantically matches the target.

3) Link only if it improves user task completion or adds essential depth; avoid generic/duplicate links.

4) Reject if target is a comparison/brand page and the paragraph does not explicitly compare all the brands mentioned in the target link. For example linking a opentelemetry vs splunk article on opentelemetry keyword

